---
// Features.astro - Bento Grid Visual de Alto Impacto con Mockups Reales de Interfaz
---

<section class="features-section scroll-reveal" id="funciones">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-init">
      <span class="section-kicker">Lo que puedes hacer</span>
      <h2>Todo lo que necesitas para tu semestre, en grande</h2>
      <p>
        Nació de problemas reales en la ESPE: horarios que no abren, notas al filo del abismo y tareas olvidadas a medianoche. Diseñada con interfaces visuales que te ahorran tiempo cada día.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Asimétrico con Diseños UI Ricos -->
    <div class="bento-grid">
      
      <!-- BENTO 1: Malla Curricular Inteligente (PROTAGONISTA - 2 Columnas) -->
      <article class="bento-card bento-hero-span card-app reveal-init">
        <div class="bento-card-header">
          <div class="bento-icon-wrapper green">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5-2.5Z"></path>
              <path d="M6 6h10"></path>
              <path d="M6 10h10"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-title-group">
            <span class="badge-app green">Sin internet · 23 carreras oficiales</span>
            <h3>Tu malla curricular visual con proyección de graduación</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="bento-desc">
          Las 23 carreras oficiales de la ESPE ya vienen cargadas. Marca lo aprobado y la app calcula tu fecha estimada de graduación y te alerta en ámbar la ruta crítica de materias que te pueden atrasar.
        </p>

        <!-- Mockup Visual Rico: Dashboard de Avance y Grafo de Materias -->
        <div class="bento-ui-mockup mockup-malla-board" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="malla-kpi-row">
            <div class="malla-kpi-card">
              <span class="kpi-label">AÑO ESTIMADO</span>
              <div class="kpi-val-group">
                <span class="kpi-num text-amber">2029</span>
                <span class="kpi-badge-live">Octubre</span>
              </div>
              <span class="kpi-sub">Ritmo: 24 créditos / semestre</span>
            </div>

            <div class="malla-kpi-card right">
              <span class="kpi-label">AVANCE DE CRÉDITOS</span>
              <div class="kpi-val-group">
                <span class="kpi-num text-green">44.2%</span>
                <span class="kpi-sub-fraction">106 / 240</span>
              </div>
              <div class="malla-glow-track">
                <div class="malla-glow-bar" style="width: 44.2%;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Alerta de Ruta Crítica -->
          <div class="malla-critical-banner">
            <div class="critical-icon-badge">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"></path>
                <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="critical-content">
              <div class="critical-title">RUTA CRÍTICA DETECTADA: ECUACIONES DIFERENCIALES</div>
              <div class="critical-desc">Esta materia encadena 4 materias clave posteriores. Si no la pasas, retrasas tu titulación.</div>
            </div>
            <span class="critical-urgency-tag">MÁXIMA PRIORIDAD</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Grafo Visual de Materias Encadenadas -->
          <div class="malla-chain-graph">
            <div class="graph-node passed">
              <span class="node-status-icon">✓</span>
              <span class="node-title">Cálculo I</span>
              <span class="node-cr">4 CR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="graph-connector passed"></div>
            <div class="graph-node passed">
              <span class="node-status-icon">✓</span>
              <span class="node-title">Cálculo II</span>
              <span class="node-cr">4 CR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="graph-connector warning"></div>
            <div class="graph-node warning-active">
              <span class="node-status-icon">⚠️</span>
              <span class="node-title">Ec. Diferenciales</span>
              <span class="node-cr">4 CR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="graph-connector locked"></div>
            <div class="graph-node locked">
              <span class="node-status-icon">🔒</span>
              <span class="node-title">Métodos Numéricos</span>
              <span class="node-cr">3 CR</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-chips-row">
          <span class="chip-app">23 Carreras ESPE</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Proyección de Graduación</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Alerta de Ruta Crítica</span>
          <span class="chip-app">100% Offline</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 2: Horario Banner & Aulas Inteligentes (1 Columna) -->
      <article class="bento-card card-app reveal-init">
        <div class="bento-card-header">
          <div class="bento-icon-wrapper amber">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-title-group">
            <span class="badge-app amber">Banner ESPE & Aulas 1-Tap</span>
            <h3>Aulas en 3 formatos y contexto 'EN VIVO'</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="bento-desc">
          Alterna entre código conciso (A-110, G-201), descriptivo (Bloque A · Piso 1) o híbrido en 1 toque. Tu clase en curso resalta con borde esmeralda, badge [ AHORA ], tiempo restante exacto y auto-scroll semanal al día de hoy.
        </p>

        <!-- Mockup Visual Rico: Widget Flotante estilo Android 14 -->
        <div class="bento-ui-mockup widget-showcase-container" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="android-phone-header">
            <span class="phone-time">09:42</span>
            <div class="phone-icons-row">
              <span class="icon-wifi">📶</span>
              <span class="icon-battery">88%</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="android-widget-card">
            <div class="widget-accent-stripe"></div>
            <div class="widget-inner-body">
              <div class="widget-meta-top">
                <span class="widget-pill-live">
                  <span class="live-dot-pulse"></span>
                  EN VIVO · FALTAN 18 MIN
                </span>
                <span class="widget-nrc-code">NRC 14205</span>
              </div>
              <div class="widget-room-hero">Aula A-204 · Bloque Central (Piso 2)</div>
              <div class="widget-subject-name">Sistemas Operativos · Modo Híbrido</div>

              <div class="widget-teams-btn">
                <div class="teams-logo-badge">
                  <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                    <rect width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#4f52b2"/>
                    <path d="M12 9v6m-3-4.5h6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="teams-text-group">
                  <span class="teams-main">Unirse a Microsoft Teams</span>
                  <span class="teams-url-hint">teams.microsoft.com/meet/14205</span>
                </div>
                <span class="teams-action-arrow">➔</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-chips-row">
          <span class="chip-app">3 Formatos de Aula</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Clase 'EN VIVO'</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Tiempo Restante</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Auto-Scroll Semanal</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Widget Android</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 3: Carnet Digital Inmersivo con Zoom Táctil (1 Columna) -->
      <article class="bento-card card-app reveal-init">
        <div class="bento-card-header">
          <div class="bento-icon-wrapper green">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
              <circle cx="9" cy="10" r="2"></circle>
              <line x1="15" y1="8" x2="17" y2="8"></line>
              <line x1="15" y1="12" x2="17" y2="12"></line>
              <line x1="7" y1="16" x2="17" y2="16"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-title-group">
            <span class="badge-app green">100% Offline · Zoom Táctil & QR</span>
            <h3>Carnet digital inmersivo para el guardia y torniquetes</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="bento-desc">
          Visor a pantalla completa con zoom táctil nítido (InteractiveViewer), sin pantallas intermedias ni textos duplicados. Conmutador de 1-toque para ocultar tu cédula con feedback háptico y QR dinámico offline.
        </p>

        <!-- Mockup Visual Rico: Carnet Estudiantil Interactivo con Giro 3D -->
        <div class="bento-ui-mockup carnet-showcase-container" id="carnet-container">
          <div class="carnet-card-flipper" id="carnet-flipper">
            <!-- Anverso del Carnet -->
            <div class="carnet-side carnet-front">
              <div class="carnet-top-brand">
                <div class="carnet-logo-group">
                  <span class="carnet-star">★</span>
                  <span class="carnet-espe-logo">ESPE</span>
                </div>
                <span class="carnet-campus-name">CAMPUS SANGOLQUÍ</span>
              </div>
              <div class="carnet-body-grid">
                <div class="carnet-photo-box">
                  <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="student-avatar-svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="photo-active-dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="carnet-data-box">
                  <div class="student-name">ESTUDIANTE ESPE</div>
                  <div class="student-career">ING. MECÁNICA</div>
                  <div class="student-id">L00412890</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="carnet-barcode-row">
                <!-- Barcode SVG realista de alta densidad -->
                <svg class="carnet-svg-barcode" width="140" height="24" viewBox="0 0 140 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <rect x="0" y="0" width="3" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="5" y="0" width="1.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="8" y="0" width="4" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="14" y="0" width="1" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="17" y="0" width="2.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="22" y="0" width="3" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="27" y="0" width="1" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="30" y="0" width="4" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="36" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="40" y="0" width="1.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="43" y="0" width="3.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="49" y="0" width="1" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="52" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="56" y="0" width="4" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="62" y="0" width="1.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="65" y="0" width="3" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="70" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="74" y="0" width="1" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="77" y="0" width="3.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="83" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="87" y="0" width="4" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="93" y="0" width="1" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="96" y="0" width="2.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="101" y="0" width="3" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="106" y="0" width="1.5" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="110" y="0" width="4" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="116" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="120" y="0" width="1" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="123" y="0" width="3" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="128" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="132" y="0" width="4" height="24"></rect>
                  <rect x="138" y="0" width="2" height="24"></rect>
                </svg>
                <span class="carnet-valid-tag">2026-1</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Reverso del Carnet -->
            <div class="carnet-side carnet-back">
              <div class="carnet-back-header">ACCESO A GARITAS INSTITUCIONALES</div>
              <div class="carnet-qr-frame">
                <!-- QR SVG Vectorial Real -->
                <svg class="carnet-svg-qr" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#000" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M2 2h7v7H2V2zm2 2v3h3V4H4zm11-2h7v7h-7V2zm2 2v3h3V4h-3zM2 15h7v7H2v-7zm2 2v3h3v-3H4zm8-13h2v2h-2V4zm0 4h2v2h-2V8zm4 0h2v2h-2V8zm-2 4h2v2h-2v-2zm-2 2h2v2h-2v-2zm4 0h2v2h-2v-2zm2-2h2v2h-2v-2zm0 4h2v2h-2v-2zm-6 2h2v2h-2v-2zm4 0h2v2h-2v-2zm2 2h2v2h-2v-2z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="carnet-emergency-note">Cédula: 1729384710 · Seguro Activo</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="carnet-flip-ctrl">
            <button type="button" class="btn-flip-carnet" id="btn-flip-carnet" aria-label="Girar carnet estudiantil">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="m3 12 4-4 4 4"></path>
                <path d="M7 8v8a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h9"></path>
                <path d="m21 12-4 4-4-4"></path>
                <path d="M17 16V8a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H4"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Toca para ver el reverso (QR institucional)</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-chips-row">
          <span class="chip-app">Visor Inmersivo</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Zoom Táctil</span>
          <span class="chip-app">QR Dinámico Offline</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Privacidad 1-Tap</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Modo Alto Brillo</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 4: Calculadora Oficial ESPE 33.34 / 33.33 / 33.33 (2 Columnas) -->
      <article class="bento-card bento-hero-span card-app reveal-init">
        <div class="bento-card-header">
          <div class="bento-icon-wrapper amber">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path>
              <path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-title-group">
            <span class="badge-app amber">Reglamento Oficial ESPE (33.34% / 33.33% / 33.33%)</span>
            <h3>Calculadora de notas oficial ESPE: ¿Con cuántos puntos pasas?</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="bento-desc">
          Cálculo matemático de máxima precisión conforme al reglamento de evaluación institucional ESPE: P1 = 33.34%, P2 = 33.33% y Examen Final = 33.33%. Conoce tu progreso hacia el umbral de aprobación de 42.00 / 60.00 pts (promedio ≥ 14.00) y simula metas en 1 toque.
        </p>

        <!-- Mockup Visual Rico: Simulador de Notas con Sliders y Medidor -->
        <div class="bento-ui-mockup calc-interactive-simulator" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="calc-top-header">
            <div class="calc-grade-display">
              <span class="calc-big-val text-amber">44.80</span>
              <span class="calc-max-val">/ 60.00 pts</span>
              <span class="calc-verdict-badge approved">✓ APROBADO (14.93)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="calc-target-selector">
              <span class="target-chip active">14.00 · Mínimo</span>
              <span class="target-chip">16.00 · Beca</span>
              <span class="target-chip">18.00 · Excelencia</span>
              <span class="target-chip">Personalizada</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="calc-sliders-container">
            <!-- Slider Parcial 1 -->
            <div class="calc-slider-card">
              <div class="slider-info-row">
                <span class="slider-name">PARCIAL 1 (Ponderación 33.34%)</span>
                <span class="slider-value-pill text-green">15.50 / 20</span>
              </div>
              <div class="slider-track-visual">
                <div class="slider-fill-visual green-gradient" style="width: 77.5%;"></div>
                <div class="slider-thumb-dot" style="left: 77.5%;"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="slider-contrib-text">Aporta 15.50 pts acumulados al umbral de 42 pts</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Slider Parcial 2 -->
            <div class="calc-slider-card">
              <div class="slider-info-row">
                <span class="slider-name">PARCIAL 2 (Ponderación 33.33%)</span>
                <span class="slider-value-pill text-green">14.50 / 20</span>
              </div>
              <div class="slider-track-visual">
                <div class="slider-fill-visual green-gradient" style="width: 72.5%;"></div>
                <div class="slider-thumb-dot" style="left: 72.5%;"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="slider-contrib-text">Llegas a 30.00 / 60 pts acumulados (Faltan 12.00 para 42)</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Meta Examen Final -->
            <div class="calc-slider-card target-needed-card">
              <div class="slider-info-row">
                <span class="slider-name-target">EXAMEN FINAL REQUERIDO (33.33%)</span>
                <span class="slider-target-result text-amber">MÍNIMO 12.00 / 20</span>
              </div>
              <div class="slider-track-visual target">
                <div class="slider-fill-visual amber-gradient" style="width: 60%;"></div>
                <div class="slider-thumb-dot amber" style="left: 60%;"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="slider-contrib-text amber">Necesitas 12.00 en el examen final para alcanzar los 42.00 puntos y aprobar</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-chips-row">
          <span class="chip-app">Fórmula 33.34 / 33.33 / 33.33</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Umbral 42.00 / 60 Pts</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Metas Rápidas 1-Tap</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Simulador en Vivo</span>
          <span class="chip-app">Acceso a Materiales</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 5: Amigos QR y Horas Libres Comunes (2 Columnas) -->
      <article class="bento-card bento-hero-span card-app reveal-init">
        <div class="bento-card-header">
          <div class="bento-icon-wrapper green">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-title-group">
            <span class="badge-app green">P2P Gzip · Sin Internet</span>
            <h3>¿A qué hora coincidimos libres para almorzar o estudiar?</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="bento-desc">
          Pasa tu horario escaneando un código QR comprimido de pantalla a cámara, sin internet. La app compara automáticamente los horarios de tus compañeros y resalta los huecos libres exactos en común.
        </p>

        <!-- Mockup Visual Rico: Comparador de Cronogramas con Bloque Libre Resaltado -->
        <div class="bento-ui-mockup friends-timeline-mockup" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="friends-match-hero-bar">
            <div class="match-sparkle-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="match-hero-text">
              <span class="match-title-strong">¡COINCIDENCIA ENCONTRADA: 2 HORAS LIBRES JUNTOS!</span>
              <span class="match-time-sub">Martes y Jueves · 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM (Ambos tienen hueco)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="match-plan-pill">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"></path>
                <path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"></path>
                <line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"></line>
                <line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"></line>
                <line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"></line>
              </svg>
              Almorzar en Sangolquí
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-comparison-grid">
            <!-- Columna Usuario -->
            <div class="timeline-column">
              <div class="timeline-user-tag">
                <span class="user-avatar-mini">T</span>
                <span>Tu Horario</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-slots">
                <div class="slot-item busy">
                  <span class="slot-hour">07:00 - 09:00</span>
                  <span class="slot-class">Cálculo Vectorial (A-201)</span>
                </div>
